<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Mulpha to buy land owning firm.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Mulpha to buy land owning firm.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Mulpha International Bhd said on Friday its wholly-owned unit has signed an agreement to buy the entire issued and paid-up capital of a land-owning firm for 101.29 million ringgit.</p>
<p>Mulpha, a property and trading concern, said the plan to buy Spanstead Sdn Bhd would increase its landbank.</p>
<p>Spanstead owns leasehold land totalling 1,186 acres in central Selangor state.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
